# ── .NET build output ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Everything under bin/ and obj/ is reproduced by a plain build. Every DLL the
# projects use comes from NuGet (all *.csproj use PackageReference, no HintPath
# to a loose DLL anywhere), so `dotnet restore` / MSBuild restore brings back
# the exact versions pinned in the csproj files. Nothing binary needs committing.
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/

# Final build output of scripts/build-all.ps1 (payloads + single-EXE installer).
dist/

# Archive of shipped client installers (~67 MB each) — build-all.ps1 deploy
# target, not source. Keep these in normal file storage, not in git history.
shared/bin/

# Host-simulation payload assembled from build output (duplicates the 57 MB
# whisper model + Whisper.net DLLs that NuGet restores). The source of the
# scratch tool (Program.cs, VoiceTest.csproj) stays tracked.
scratch-voicetest/hostsim/

# ── Node ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# package-lock.json IS tracked: after cloning, `npm ci` reinstalls byte-exact
# versions of everything (here only the tailwindcss build-time toolchain).
node_modules/

# ── IDE / user-specific state ────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.DotSettings.user

# ── Test & tooling residue ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
TestResults/
*.log
npm-debug.log*

# CorelDRAW auto-backups created next to any opened test file.
Backup_of_*.cdr

# ── Deliberately TRACKED, do not add rules for these ─────────────────────────
# assets/voice/ggml-model.bin (57 MB): ships inside the installer, never
#   downloaded at runtime (O16) — a fresh clone must build a complete installer.
# docs/**/*.cdr: the measured fixtures behind the locked decisions (O8/O10/O15).
# docs/vgcore-tlb-dump.txt: the authoritative VGCore typelib dump.
